    "Description": "A transparency slide showing the right side of a freshly painted carousel pig. The skin of the pig is a light tan. The saddle is light brown, yellow, and black. The tack is black, yellow, red, and pink. The saddle blanket is pink, yellow, orange, and green. The pig is suspended on a pole with a white backdrop. The slide reads “PULLEN PARK CAROUSEL PULLEN PARK 8-3-81 Right 16A” at the top and “RALEIGH NC WAKE CO RR RALEIGH FINE ARTS SOCIETY” at the bottom. “RALEIGH FINE ARTS SOCIETY” has been crossed out.",
